    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong><br>In the dystopian future, you are tasked with delivering across the galactic empire. Complete deliveries by ensuring safe travel aboard the train, making the business thrive! From your CCTV you can monitor and react to all incidents within the train. All of your tools utilise the power, which you must manage or risk leaving the entire train open for the taking. Package thieves aim to ruin your career prospects. Avoid their ambushes and keep them away from the customers packages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Managers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/afae04f9549ef6921ab72bc40b360ade.poster.avif?t=1752528748\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/afae04f9549ef6921ab72bc40b360ade.webm?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/afae04f9549ef6921ab72bc40b360ade.mp4?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future is bright, but not for you. People need their damn packages on time, and you\u2019ve got a tight schedule. Board the train, and keep it going until you reach the destination. Stop those pesky parcel thieves and sacrifice your life if you must, you\u2019re all replaceable anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train Simulation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/3ab68321bc7730dd479f30ee6a41438f.poster.avif?t=1752528748\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/3ab68321bc7730dd479f30ee6a41438f.webm?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/3ab68321bc7730dd479f30ee6a41438f.mp4?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the train juice to keep the power running! Run out? That\u2019ll come out of YOUR pay check.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(maybe) Kind Enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/df30dcbb7f8f921490baa71547680a2a.poster.avif?t=1752528748\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/df30dcbb7f8f921490baa71547680a2a.webm?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/df30dcbb7f8f921490baa71547680a2a.mp4?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019ll be a few people out to get you, but not to worry! Simply sacrifice yourself for that sweet sweet bonus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust our Reviews!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/7c8588c8eb8021773e2f1ebb86cfd317.poster.avif?t=1752528748\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/7c8588c8eb8021773e2f1ebb86cfd317.webm?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/7c8588c8eb8021773e2f1ebb86cfd317.mp4?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI ordered my new charger from the Planetary Delivery Boys and it said it\u2019d take two days to arrive! Good thing I had Planetary Delivery Plus allowing it to enter my solar system by the end of the day! How could people live without it!\u201d - A Planet Delivery Plus member</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong><br>In the dystopian future, you are tasked with delivering across the galactic empire. Complete deliveries by ensuring safe travel aboard the train, making the business thrive! From your CCTV you can monitor and react to all incidents within the train. All of your tools utilise the power, which you must manage or risk leaving the entire train open for the taking. Package thieves aim to ruin your career prospects. Avoid their ambushes and keep them away from the customers packages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Managers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/afae04f9549ef6921ab72bc40b360ade.poster.avif?t=1752528748\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/afae04f9549ef6921ab72bc40b360ade.webm?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/afae04f9549ef6921ab72bc40b360ade.mp4?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future is bright, but not for you. People need their damn packages on time, and you\u2019ve got a tight schedule. Board the train, and keep it going until you reach the destination. Stop those pesky parcel thieves and sacrifice your life if you must, you\u2019re all replaceable anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train Simulation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/3ab68321bc7730dd479f30ee6a41438f.poster.avif?t=1752528748\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/3ab68321bc7730dd479f30ee6a41438f.webm?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/3ab68321bc7730dd479f30ee6a41438f.mp4?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the train juice to keep the power running! Run out? That\u2019ll come out of YOUR pay check.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(maybe) Kind Enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/df30dcbb7f8f921490baa71547680a2a.poster.avif?t=1752528748\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/df30dcbb7f8f921490baa71547680a2a.webm?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/df30dcbb7f8f921490baa71547680a2a.mp4?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019ll be a few people out to get you, but not to worry! Simply sacrifice yourself for that sweet sweet bonus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust our Reviews!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/7c8588c8eb8021773e2f1ebb86cfd317.poster.avif?t=1752528748\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/7c8588c8eb8021773e2f1ebb86cfd317.webm?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/7c8588c8eb8021773e2f1ebb86cfd317.mp4?t=1752528748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI ordered my new charger from the Planetary Delivery Boys and it said it\u2019d take two days to arrive! Good thing I had Planetary Delivery Plus allowing it to enter my solar system by the end of the day! How could people live without it!\u201d - A Planet Delivery Plus member</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
